LittlerootTown_Text_OurNewHomeLetsGoInside:: @ 816A7C9
	.string "ECHO: {PLAYER}... wake up.\p"
	.string "This truck was caught in the\n"
	.string "same glitch as you. LITTLEROOT\p"
	.string "is a shelter, not your home.\p"
	.string "The world borrowed a familiar\n"
	.string "voice so you would trust it.\p"
	.string "Come inside and stabilize your\n"
	.string "signal.$"

LittlerootTown_Text_WaitPlayer:: @ 816A8EE
	.string "MOM: Wait, {PLAYER}!$"

LittlerootTown_Text_WearTheseRunningShoes:: @ 816A8FD
	.string "ECHO: Your partner found you!\n"
	.string "That bond survived the crossing.\p"
	.string "Take these RUNNING SHOES. Hold B\n"
	.string "to run. The gate home is still\p"
	.string "far away.$"

LittlerootTown_Text_SwitchShoesWithRunningShoes:: @ 816AA32
	.string "{PLAYER} switched shoes with the\n"
	.string "RUNNING SHOES.$"

LittlerootTown_Text_ExplainRunningShoes:: @ 816AA5C
	.string "MOM: {PLAYER}, those shoes came with\n"
	.string "instructions.\p"
	.string "“Press the B Button while wearing these\n"
	.string "RUNNING SHOES to run extra-fast!\p"
	.string "“Slip on these RUNNING SHOES and race\n"
	.string "in the great outdoors!”$"

LittlerootTown_Text_ComeHomeIfAnythingHappens:: @ 816AB10
	.string "ECHO: If the glitch overwhelms\n"
	.string "you, return here to rest.\p"
	.string "I am only a memory of home. But\n"
	.string "the people waiting for you are\p"
	.string "real. Go find the DIGITAL KEYS.$"

LittlerootTown_Text_CanUsePCToStoreItems:: @ 816AC00
	.string "If you use a PC, you can store items\n"
	.string "and DIGIMON.\p"
	.string "The power of science is staggering!$"

LittlerootTown_Text_BirchSpendsDaysInLab:: @ 816AC56
	.string "PROF. BIRCH spends days in his LAB\n"
	.string "studying, then he'll suddenly go out in\l"
	.string "the wild to do more research...\p"
	.string "When does PROF. BIRCH spend time\n"
	.string "at home?$"

LittlerootTown_Text_IfYouGoInGrassPokemonWillJumpOut:: @ 816ACEB
	.string "If you go in the tall grass at the sides\n"
	.string "of this road, wild DIGIMON will appear.$"

LittlerootTown_Text_DangerousIfYouDontHavePokemon:: @ 816AD3C
	.string "It's not safe to go out there if you\n"
	.string "don't have any DIGIMON with you.$"

LittlerootTown_Text_CanYouGoSeeWhatsHappening:: @ 816AD82
	.string "I can hear someone shouting down the\n"
	.string "road here.\p"
	.string "What should I do? What should we do?\n"
	.string "Somebody has to go help...$"

LittlerootTown_Text_YouSavedBirch:: @ 816ADF2
	.string "Boy, am I glad you went and rescued\n"
	.string "the PROFESSOR.$"

LittlerootTown_Text_GoodLuckCatchingPokemon:: @ 816AE25
	.string "Are you going to catch DIGIMON?\n"
	.string "Good luck!$"

LittlerootTown_Text_TownSign:: @ 816AE50
	.string "LITTLEROOT: STABLE SIGNAL ZONE\p"
	.string "Beyond this refuge lies a world\n"
	.string "caught between code and matter.$"

LittlerootTown_Text_ProfBirchsLab:: @ 816AE87
	.string "PROF. BIRCH'S DIGIMON LAB$"

LittlerootTown_Text_PlayersHouse:: @ 816AEA1
	.string "{PLAYER}'s HOUSE$"

LittlerootTown_Text_ProfBirchsHouse:: @ 816AEAC
	.string "PROF. BIRCH'S HOUSE$"
